  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "**Now, people’s preferences have changed. You also have a new program to explore.** \r\n\r\nSome people are wearing sweaters: they prefer a colder temperature. Others are wearing t-shirts: they prefer a warmer temperature.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Explore how the program behaves. Run it at least ten times.\r\n- Continue to the next level. You'll answer a question about this experiment.\r\n",
